Sure! Below is a simple HTML code for a landing page for a dog petting café. You can customize the content, colors, and images as needed.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wagging Tails Café</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #ffcc00;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5em;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
        .hero-image {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
        .cta-button {
            background-color: #ff6600;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #cc5200;
        }
        footer {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to Wagging Tails Café</h1>
        <p>Your favorite place to relax and play with dogs!</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <img src="dog-cafe.jpg" alt="Happy dogs in café" class="hero-image">
        <h2>Join Us for a Pawsome Experience!</h2>
        <p>At Wagging Tails Café, you can enjoy a cup of coffee while spending time with friendly dogs looking for love and attention.</p>

        <a href="#reserve" class="cta-button">Reserve Your Spot</a>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Contact Us: info@waggingtailscafe.com | (123) 456-7890</p>
        <p>&copy; 2023 Wagging Tails Café</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
```

### Instructions to Use:
1. **Create a new file**: Open a text editor (like Notepad, VS Code, or Sublime Text).
2. **Copy the code**: Paste the above HTML code into the file.
3. **Save the file**: Save it as `index.html`.
4. **Add a hero image**: Replace the `src` in `<img src="dog-cafe.jpg">` with a path to a relevant image of your dog café.
5. **Open in a browser**: You can open the `index.html` file in any web browser to view your landing page.

Feel free to adjust styles, text, and images to match your café’s branding!

